---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Our Services" description="Health for your whole life. Personalised care for every stage.">

  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="eyebrow">Services</span>
      <h1>Health for your whole life.</h1>
      <p class="lead" style="margin-top: 16px;">Everyone benefits from continuity, coordination, and a long-term relationship with their doctor.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-ivory">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="max-prose fade-up">
        <p style="font-size: var(--body-lg); color: var(--fg-1); line-height: 1.7;">Patients come to us for different reasons, but they share one need: a doctor who understands their health in context and follows their care over time.</p>
        <p style="margin-top: 20px;">Whether you are living with a complex condition, focused on maintaining high performance, or prioritise caring for your family, we provide thoughtful, coordinated and personalised medical care for your needs.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-sunken" id="performance-prevention">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="split fade-up">
        <div class="split-image">
          <img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67812a141d8f2465fe6175eb/6971fab5aaba75a1d791e909_oleg-kukharuk-pU2XzuGa9ro-unsplash%20(1).jpg" alt="Performance and prevention" />
        </div>
        <div class="split-content">
          <span class="eyebrow">Performance & prevention</span>
          <h2>Staying healthy,<br>staying ahead.</h2>
          <p>Healthcare is not only about treating illness. It should be about understanding your medical history, lifestyle, and goals, and making informed decisions that support your long-term wellbeing.</p>
          <p style="margin-top: 16px;">Through regular consultations, laboratory testing, and ongoing monitoring, we identify early changes, manage risks proactively, and support your health.</p>
          <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-outline" style="margin-top: 28px;">Start your care</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-ivory" id="healthy-aging">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="split reverse fade-up">
        <div class="split-image">
          <img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67812a141d8f2465fe6175eb/69c1164a7313ff3a7daadc19_foundation-clinic-who7.webp" alt="Healthy aging" />
        </div>
        <div class="split-content">
          <span class="eyebrow">Healthy aging</span>
          <h2>Peace of mind for<br>the years ahead.</h2>
          <p>Health needs often become more complex with age. Managing multiple conditions, medications, and specialist consultations can make healthcare difficult to navigate.</p>
          <p style="margin-top: 16px;">Your doctor acts as the main point of contact for reviewing test results, specialist reports, and treatment plans to ensure that your care remains clear and consistent.</p>
          <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-outline" style="margin-top: 28px;">Start your care</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-sunken" id="children-families">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="split fade-up">
        <div class="split-image">
          <img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67812a141d8f2465fe6175eb/69c1164b3d23e55291cebba7_foundation-clinic-who11.webp" alt="Children and families" />
        </div>
        <div class="split-content">
          <span class="eyebrow">Children & families</span>
          <h2>One doctor for you<br>and your whole family.</h2>
          <p>We support families with both preventive care and everyday medical concerns. When a child becomes ill, parents can reach their family doctor who already knows the medical context.</p>
          <p style="margin-top: 16px;">Our model complements Finland's neuvola system by providing access to a dedicated doctor for medical questions, acute illnesses, and more complex situations.</p>
          <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-outline" style="margin-top: 28px;">Start your care</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-ivory" id="complex-health-needs">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="split reverse fade-up">
        <div class="split-image">
          <img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67812a141d8f2465fe6175eb/69d6375ea03a61d5a2486655_artem-kovalev-fk3XUcfTAvk-unsplash.jpg" alt="Complex health needs" />
        </div>
        <div class="split-content">
          <span class="eyebrow">Complex health needs</span>
          <h2>Trustworthy guidance<br>through difficult times.</h2>
          <p>Patients with serious medical conditions often face a fragmented healthcare system. Different specialists give advice independently, records are scattered, and it can be difficult to maintain a clear overview.</p>
          <p style="margin-top: 16px;">At Foundation, your doctor brings these pieces together. We review medical reports, coordinate specialist consultations locally and internationally, and ensure treatment decisions remain aligned.</p>
          <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-outline" style="margin-top: 28px;">Start your care</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-espresso">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="text-center fade-up" style="max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto;">
        <h2>Contact us to explore how we can support your long-term health.</h2>
        <p style="margin-top: 16px; margin-bottom: 32px;">We answer all emails within 24 hours.</p>
        <a href="/contact" class="btn" style="background: var(--cream); color: var(--espresso);">Get in touch</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</Base>